OL,3,ANew York building collapse kills at
OL,4,Aleast two, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FHours later, aerial video showed
OL,7,Ffirefighters pulling a survivor,
OL,8,Fcovered in dust, out of the debris on a
OL,9,Fstretcher. She was later said to have
OL,10,Fbeen a pregnant woman. Officials say
OL,11,Fthey do not know how many others are
OL,12,Fmissing.
OL,14,FAn investigation is under way into what
OL,15,Fcaused Wednesday afternoon's sudden
OL,16,Fcollapse.
